    "answer": {
      "short": "$x^5$, $x\\ne0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^7}{x^2}&=x^{7-2}\\\\\\frac{x^7}{x^2}&=x^5\\end{align*}$$The original denominator requires $x\\ne0$.",
